From ef8647af3f31c79fefaf5e9dda6afb3d30997c8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lhog <1476261+lhog@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Mar 2026 20:43:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Do proper modulo for heading (#2827)

* Heading should be clamped between [-pi, pi), not between [0, 2*pi), which used to cause undefined behavior when clamping into short with something like short(heading * RAD2TAANG)
* Add tests ClampRad, ClampRadPi and cast to short tests
---------

Co-authored-by: sprunk <spr.ng@o2.pl>
---
